OL,3,GNEWSAHow pausing plans to merge
OL,4,Acouncils affects Cambridgeshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to merge seven councils in
OL,7,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough are
OL,8,Fbeing reviewed.
OL,10,FThe government has decided to
OL,11,Freconsider proposals to abolish
OL,12,Ftwo-tier council systems across England
OL,13,Ffollowing new legal advice.
OL,15,FIn some areas, mergers have been
OL,16,Fscrapped, while in other areas they
OL,17,Fhave been put on hold.
OL,19,FHere is what it means for voters in
OL,20,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
